The Jac walker below ensures exactly one node of archetype 'UniqueItem' is attached from the root via an outgoing edge. It first checks if such a node exists; if not, it creates one and connects it to root. It then reports the attached node. This follows the safe check-then-create pattern.

```jac
node UniqueItem {
