This flexibility allows Jac programs to load images from various sources seamlessly, whether from local files, web URLs, cloud storage, or in-memory byte streams. It supports integration with Python libraries (`PIL.Image`) and in-memory image manipulation, making it powerful for AI and vision tasks.

